<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six stocks fell, five rose and six were flat in 17.8-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>The WIG 20 index closed at 1,810.2 points, 0.8 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat at 163 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
